# API & agent services

## Controllers (`app/api`, actions)

- Validate body with Zod; return 400 on failure
- Call one service method; map result to HTTP JSON
- No prompts, no model selection logic in the route file

## Verification agent (`services/`)

- Single orchestration entry: e.g. `verifyMilestone(input) → Verdict`
- Steps are pure-ish helpers: parse proof, web search, PDF extract, score confidence
- Always return the shared `Verdict` schema (structured output)
- Log evidence IDs and confidence; never invent sources — mark unconfirmed when unsure

## Orbio / OpenRouter

- One client module (`lib/openrouter.ts`); services import it
- Key only from `process.env.OPENROUTER_API_KEY`
- Use structured outputs for verdicts; enable web search / PDF where the claim needs it

```
❌ invent "confirmed" without a cited check
✅ confirmed[] with source URLs; unconfirmed[] with reason
```
